@opindex mpowerpc-gfxopt
@opindex mno-powerpc-gfxopt
@item -mpowerpc-gfxopt
@itemx -mno-powerpc-gfxopt
@option{-mpowerpc-gfxopt} allows GCC to
use the optional PowerPC architecture instructions in the Graphics
